abstract: >-
  A research notebook and reproducible computational toolkit investigating
  superpolynomial ordinary pigeonhole-principle lower bounds in fixed-depth
  AC^0[p]-Frege. The goal remains open; working arguments and their limitations
  are explicitly recorded.
